                "type": "e",
                "id": "yRMkhayTX38fD1eVKaEO",
                "prompt": "A warm, older female druid voice — earthy, grounded and wise, like an old forest given a voice. Gentle but firm, with a slow knowing smile and a hint of wildness underneath. Rich low-mid tone, calm cadence, never shrill, never fragile, never evil. Perfect audio quality.",
